            ],
            "Simple Social Button Settings Exported Successfully!": [
                "\u0e15\u0e31\u0e49\u0e07\u0e04\u0e48\u0e32\u0e1b\u0e38\u0e48\u0e21\u0e42\u0e0b\u0e40\u0e0a\u0e35\u0e22\u0e25\u0e07\u0e48\u0e32\u0e22 \u0e46 \u0e44\u0e14\u0e49\u0e2a\u0e48\u0e07\u0e2d\u0e2d\u0e01\u0e40\u0e23\u0e35\u0e22\u0e1a\u0e23\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e22\u0e41\u0e25\u0e49\u0e27!"
            ],
            "Export Simple Social Button Settings.": [
                "\u0e2a\u0e48\u0e07\u0e2d\u0e2d\u0e01\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e15\u0e31\u0e49\u0e07\u0e04\u0e48\u0e32\u0e1b\u0e38\u0e48\u0e21\u0e42\u0e0b\u0e40\u0e0a\u0e35\u0e22\u0e25\u0e07\u0e48\u0e32\u0e22 \u0e46"
            ],
            "<strong>Simple Social Buttons<\/strong> by <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/wpbrigade.com\/?utm_source=simple-social-buttons-lite&utm_medium=link-header&utm_campaign=pro-upgrade\">WPBrigade<\/a><\/strong> adds an advanced set of social media sharing buttons to your WordPress sites, such as: <strong>Facebook<\/strong>, <strong>Twitter\/X<\/strong>, <strong>LinkedIn<\/strong>, <strong>WhatsApp<\/strong>, <strong>Viber<\/strong>, <strong>Reddit<\/strong> and <strong>Pinterest<\/strong>. This makes it the most flexible social sharing plugin for everyone.": [
